1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:04,192
(Howard:)...I'm the only one making any real-world
contribution to science and technology.

2
00:00:04,357 --> 00:00:07,147
(Raj:)He's right. This is an important
achievement for two reasons:

3
00:00:07,319 --> 00:00:09,529
(Raj:)Number one, and of course, number two.

4
00:00:09,696 --> 00:00:11,866
[LAUGHING]

5
00:00:12,365 --> 00:00:14,155
(Sheldon:)Oh, clever.

6
00:00:14,326 --> 00:00:18,166
(Sheldon:)Playing on the use of cardinal numbers
as euphemisms for bodily functions.

7
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,660
[LAUGHS]

8
00:00:23,001 --> 00:00:25,381
(Stuart:)Here, Sheldon.
I pulled the new Hellboy for you.

9
00:00:25,545 --> 00:00:27,045
(Stuart:)It's mind-blowing.

10
00:00:27,214 --> 00:00:30,254
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, spoiler alert.

11
00:00:30,759 --> 00:00:32,589
But I didn't spoil anything.

12
00:00:32,761 --> 00:00:36,391
(Sheldon:)You told me it's mind-blowing,
so my mind is going into it pre-blown.

13
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:40,060
(Sheldon:)And once a mind is pre-blown,
it cannot be re-blown.

14
00:00:40,602 --> 00:00:43,772
(Leonard:)- I'm sorry.
- Said the Grinch to Christmas.

15
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:50,070
- Hey, can I talk to you about something?
- Sure. What's up?

16
00:00:50,237 --> 00:00:52,777
Remember I went out with Penny
a couple weeks ago?

17
00:00:52,948 --> 00:00:55,618
- Yeah, vaguely.
- Sure, you remember. That was the night...

18
00:00:55,784 --> 00:01:02,024
(Raj:)...you went to the bar and made a fool of
yourself trying to pick up strange women.

